sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Contract as Contract
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Contract: send()
    Note over Contract: Policies: contractRead, contractWrite, contractExecute
    Note over Contract: Guards (3)
    Contract->>Contract: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;draft#quot;
    Contract->>Contract: guard[1]: self.draftedAt != null
    Contract->>Contract: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Contract->>Contract: mutate.status
    Contract->>Contract: mutate.sentAt
    Contract->>EventBus: emit ContractSent on contract.sent
    Contract-->>-Client: void